# The north/south quarrel (scripts/check_hemispheres.sh): the setup
# (dune_story_setup=hemispheres) puts a northern and a southern troop at one
# sietch, passes a day, contacts the chief (map and in person) and sends the
# southern troop home; everything happens during the setup.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 15000              # the story setup runs (a day passes, the talks, the move)
checkpoint hemispheres-end
quit
